Subject: [PATCH] GB-Link: Local 2-player tab, two real GBAs on two adapters

A tab beside Setup in the launcher's GB-Link section: pick which adapter plays on port 2 and port 3,
swap them, and boot Pokemon XD with both GBAs real. The choice is stored by USB port; the other
adapters are switched off. The manager logs which adapter plays which port.

